# gradus.fab — package map facade for the autograd and ML library.
#
# Public import: importa ex "gradus:gradus" privata gradus
#
# Prefer leaf modules (Norma / Triga style — one concern per import path):
#
#   ── Layer 1: Tensor foundation ──
#   gradus:math          tensor-aware math (own copy; independent of Norma)
#   gradus:tensor        tensor construction, shape/dtype, basic ops (not autograd-aware)
#
#   ── Layer 2: Autograd core ──
#   gradus:gradient      @ radix backward wrapper; forward + companion gradient calls
#
#   ── Layer 3: Loss ──
#   gradus:loss          loss functions (MSE, cross-entropy)
#
#   ── Layer 4: Optimization ──
#   gradus:optimize      optimizers (SGD, Adam) and learning-rate schedules
#
#   ── Layer 5: NN primitives ──
#   gradus:nn            differentiable primitives: Linear, activation, norm, embedding, dropout
#
#   ── Layer 6: Architecture blocks ──
#   gradus:attention     scaled dot-product attention, causal mask, multi-head
#   gradus:transformer   transformer block, positional encoding, output head
#
#   ── Layer 7: Training and data ──
#   gradus:train         training loop, metrics, checkpointing
#   gradus:data          batching, shuffling, tokenization
#
# This file intentionally holds no genera. Import the leaf modules above.
